id: pm-web-tfk7
title: Ignore managed extension files so the scheduled issue sync can commit
description: "This repository never ignored managed extension artifacts. From pm-github 2026.10.29 the scheduled pm-github-sync installs its pinned extension into .agents/pm/extensions/pm-github, and the sync refuses those untracked files as changed paths outside its commit scope (seen in pm-starter, https://github.com/unbraind/pm-starter/actions/runs/41421550980). Ignore them and keep the registry tracked, as pm-ts-starter does."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[2]: gitignore,sync
created_at: "2026-11-02T11:40:21.464Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-02T11:40:29.521Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-02T11:40:29.436Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-02T11:40:29.436Z"
author: claude-orchestrator
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-02T11:40:27.226Z",claude-orchestrator,"Local check: with placeholder pm-github extension files in place, git ls-files --others --exclude-standard -- .agents/pm lists 0 paths, and the registry stays tracked."
files[1]{path,scope}:
  .gitignore,project
close_reason: Managed extension artifacts are ignored and the registry stays tracked; the sync's untracked-path check lists 0 paths with an installed extension present.
body: ""
